Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:05.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Picture the {\c&HE58739&}flow{\c&HF7F4F2&} as a conveyor\Nbelt that does not feel its cargo.
